# Collaboration workflow

This contract is permanent. Do not wait for the user to repeat it. Map: [docs/agents.md](docs/agents.md).

## Confirm before structural change

Stop and ask before changing: folder tree, UI / Templates / Icons contract, existing component prop APIs, `src/i18n/config.ts`, locale routing, or new architectural dependencies.

Present recommendation, advantages, disadvantages/risks, and alternatives. Implement only after confirmation.

Example: renaming `components/ui` or changing `Button` props needs confirmation. Adding `Card` with the existing CVA + props pattern does not.

## Stay inside the contract without asking

Filling design tokens, adding dictionary keys with the same schema, adding a glyph to `src/components/icons/`, or adding a UI/Template per `docs/components.md` does not need this stop.

## Update docs after the prompt when needed

If behavior, folders, components, phase status, or i18n rules changed, update `docs/` and `AGENTS.md` if needed. Also update `CLAUDE.md` in the same turn so Claude Code stays in lockstep. If nothing changed, do not touch docs. Pairing: [docs/agents.md](docs/agents.md#keep-cursor-and-claude-in-lockstep).
